{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2023-04-24 09:03:00', 'title': 'DUPONT STRENGTHENS SCIENCE-BASED CLIMATE GOALS AND RECEIVES TARGET VALIDATION FROM SBTI', 'text': 'ANNOUNCES NEW 2030 CLIMATE TARGETS - INCREASES ITS SCOPE 1 AND 2 GHG EMISSIONS REDUCTION GOAL TO 50% AND ESTABLISHES A SCOPE 3 GHG EMISSIONS REDUCTION GOAL WILMINGTON, DEL. , APRIL 24, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS 2030 EMISSIONS REDUCTION TARGETS HAVE BEEN VALIDATED BY THE SCIENCE BASED TARGET INITIATIVE (SBTI), A PARTNERSHIP BETWEEN CDP, THE UN GLOBAL COMPACT, WORLD RESOURCES INSTITUTE (WRI) AND THE WORLD WIDE FUND FOR NATURE (WWF).'}